 8. 📺 1 for the road: 223 apps, 1 hit 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 Photos: Derek Lacey/Axios, Brock Morgan

 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Brock Morgan applied to 223 jobs over two months before landing one with Fox 54 (WZDX-TV) in Huntsville, Ala., Axios Huntsville's Derek Lacey reports. 

 Morgan — who has a master's from Northwestern and graduated magna cum laude from Howard, where he played football — mostly got the generic response: "Thank you for applying, but unfortunately ... " Late last month, the North Carolina native heard back from Fox 54 about an anchor/reporter position covering sports and news. He starts at the end of September. "Glory to God!" Morgan posted on LinkedIn.

 Morgan told Axios: "A big thing I like to tell myself is fish don't jump in the boat." Share this story ... Subscribe to Axios Local , now in 41 cities. 

 
 
